  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the Pubic Debt and Assets Management Functions in the Ministry of Finance IDF Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF grant is intended  to support the modernization and implementation of Lithuanias public debt and asset management information system and the development of a risk management framework in the Debt management department of Lithuanias Ministry of Finance. The project aims at enhancing the analytical capacity of Debt management department to identify, assess and manage risks associated with Government liabilities as well as its on-lending portfolio.</narrative>
  </description>
